 the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, April to May hit 175% of normal and November to December fell to 43%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 21% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 17901 had its driest year in 2001 at 64%.</p>"}
